{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o013b","title":"曹操赴扬州募兵并遇兵变","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o013b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操与夏侯惇赴扬州募兵，陈温、周昕资兵四千余；返至龙亢多有叛卒，后再募千余人屯河内。","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"募兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"同行","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0076","role":"资兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"资兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"扬州、龙亢、铚、建平、河内","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平元年","year":190,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o013b-q","wudi-q-o009","wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde"],"chronology":"wudi-y190","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o009","basis":"初平元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,103,"O013b"],"order":63},{"id":"zhonghua-e-o069","title":"虞翻以为力不能拒不如避之，王朗自以身为汉吏宜保城邑，举兵与孙策战，败绩，浮海至东冶","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-566ab33eb8e3c3e74386","label":"正文","text":"虞翻以为力不能拒不如避之，王朗自以身为汉吏宜保城邑，举兵与孙策战，败绩，浮海至东冶","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-2f79544b24a959d2e98d","label":"正文","text":"孙策又追击大破之，朗乃诣策，策以其儒雅诘让而不害","evidence":["zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d3144cd3eb2010b20ce4","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"孙策率军如闽越讨王朗；朗泛舟浮海欲走交州，为兵所逼遂诣军降","evidence":["zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-f0f4e29100f551149fb8","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"孙策令使者诘故会稽太守王朗，责其阻兵安忍、捕得云降庶以欺诈","evidence":["zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-79e7b19315689b9a0385","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"王朗称禽虏，对使者自陈琐才误窃朝私、畏死苟免、委命下隶、死有余辜","evidence":["zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-39b17fbc481227b644ef","label":"裴注·汉晋春秋","text":"孙策之始得王朗也谴让之，使张昭私问朗，朗誓不屈；策忿而不敢害，留置曲阿","evidence":["zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-c51a7e7ec7b7f63a5a61","label":"正文","text":"会稽太守王朗拒策于固陵，策数渡水战不能克","evidence":["zongshi-q-812211891c45b57fe0f7"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-71dd3caccfae93c66b14","label":"正文","text":"策乃诈令军中：顷连雨水浊兵饮之多腹痛，令促具罂缶数百口澄水；至昏暮，罗以燃火诳朗","evidence":["zongshi-q-0871ec4bcb18052d7928"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-459dae87f17884f6da54","label":"正文","text":"策便分军夜投查渎道，袭高迁屯","evidence":["zongshi-q-ab16c68fef2d24ca3355"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-078ff85c54901733f5c2","label":"正文","text":"朗大惊，遣故丹杨太守周昕等帅兵前战；策破昕等，斩之，遂定会稽","evidence":["zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e"]},{"id":"yululu-a-9061a3bf41ae7dbcf66c","label":"正文","text":"虞翻脱缞入见劝王朗避孙策，朗不能用","evidence":["yululu-q-e7d7718a17208557d2a3"]},{"id":"yululu-a-225e85a1daa500288c71","label":"正文","text":"王朗拒战孙策败绩，亡走浮海","evidence":["yululu-q-df33c5d11094d6f092b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0309","role":"举兵与策战败绩者；诣策受诘让而不害者；泛海被逼诣降者；被诘之故会稽太守；对使者自陈之降虏；誓不屈者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"劝避之之功曹","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"与之战之江东势力主；追击大破并诘让王朗者；讨朗者；令使者诘朗者；谴让留置朗者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"奉使私问者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"帅兵被斩者","evidence":["zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","source_order":[13,227,7],"order":2897},{"id":"feipin-e-da3e0b65ac9dec9e5940","title":"吴景随征受骑都尉，袁术表丹杨守讨周昕","accounts":[{"id":"feipin-a-da3e0b65ac9dec9e5940","label":"正文","text":"吴景随征受骑都尉，袁术表丹杨守讨周昕","evidence":["feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0039","role":"作战受任者","evidence":["feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"]},{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"表任者","evidence":["feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"]},{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"被讨者","evidence":["feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"]},"ordering_evidence":"feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97","order":9009},{"id":"zongshi-e-o112","title":"曹公起义兵，昕前后遣兵万余人助公征伐","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-de4559854789f1d7e66b","label":"裴注·会稽典录","text":"曹公起义兵，昕前后遣兵万余人助公征伐","evidence":["zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"遣兵相助者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"起义兵受助者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b","source_order":[51,18,61],"order":9116},{"id":"zongshi-e-o113","title":"袁术之在淮南也，昕恶其淫虐，绝不与通","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-492a3e3a8c4d3795cc8f","label":"裴注·会稽典录","text":"袁术之在淮南也，昕恶其淫虐，绝不与通","evidence":["zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"绝交者","evidence":["zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237","source_order":[51,18,81],"order":9117},{"id":"zongshi-e-o114","title":"袁术遣吴景攻周昕，未拔；景乃募百姓：敢从周昕者，死不赦","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-e052ef479628b65c786d","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"袁术遣吴景攻周昕，未拔；景乃募百姓：敢从周昕者，死不赦","evidence":["zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-9f19abb3ecaac2c25988","label":"裴注·献帝春秋","text":"昕曰我则不德，百姓何罪！遂散兵，还本郡","evidence":["zongshi-q-c57afd5d06b14ea17db8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"遣者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0039","role":"攻昕者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27"]},{"person":"wudi-p0077","role":"被攻者；散兵还郡者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27","zongshi-q-c57afd5d06b14ea17db8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27","zongshi-q-c57afd5d06b14ea17db8"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27","source_order":[51,18,110],"order":9118}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0077","name":"周昕","evidence":["wudi-q-o013","sunshi-q-p025","zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e","zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b","zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237","zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27","zongshi-q-c57afd5d06b14ea17db8","zongshi-q2-70570bb8e791b87dc37b","feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97"],"facts":[{"id":"zongshi-f2-bda5353e91615a0e3454","text":"辟太尉府，举高第，稍迁丹杨太守。","evidence":["zongshi-q2-70570bb8e791b87dc37b"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o013-wudi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o013"]},{"id":"sunshi-m-p025-wudi-p0077","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-p025"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-cbda3475957a02e7fc97","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-913913df849dedebb73d","layer":"original","quote":"景常随坚征伐有功，拜骑都尉。袁术上景领丹杨太守，讨故太守周昕，遂据其郡。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":75,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p025","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-54ebba26fc45acf3b625","layer":"pei","quote":"㬂字仁明。周昕之弟也。","attribution":"裴注人物释文","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-094b7d654dbb413a3f27","start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o013b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6d90d341ed08685dd83b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖兵少，乃与夏侯惇等诣扬州募兵〖21〗。刺史陈温、丹杨太守周昕与兵四千余人〖22〗；还到龙亢〖23〗，士卒多叛。﹝一﹞至铚、建平〖24〗，复收兵得千余人。进屯河内。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":196,"end":279,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o013","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6d90d341ed08685dd83b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖到酸枣。诸军兵十余万，日置酒高会，不图进取。太祖责让之〖13〗，因为谋曰：“诸君听吾计：使勃海引河内之众临孟津〖14〗；酸枣诸将守成皋，据敖仓〖15〗，塞轘辕、太谷〖16〗，全制其险；使袁将军率南阳之军军丹、析〖17〗，入武关〖18〗，以震三辅〖19〗。皆高垒深壁，勿与战；益为疑兵〖20〗，示天下形势。以顺诛逆，可立定也！今兵以义动，持疑而不进，失天下之望。窃为诸君耻之！”邈等不能用。太祖兵少，乃与夏侯惇等诣扬州募兵〖21〗。刺史陈温、丹杨太守周昕与兵四千余人〖22〗；还到龙亢〖23〗，士卒多叛。﹝一﹞至铚、建平〖24〗，复收兵得千余人。进屯河内。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":279,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-df33c5d11094d6f092b4","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ea6aaeb29afc5ea6f7f6","layer":"original","quote":"拒战败绩〖5〗，亡走浮海","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":77,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-e7d7718a17208557d2a3","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ea6aaeb29afc5ea6f7f6","layer":"original","quote":"朗欲就之〖4〗，翻乃脱缞入见，劝朗避策。朗不能用","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-35137d7d4bb0dcd52101","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"朗称‘禽虏’，对使者曰：‘朗以琐才，误窃朝私；受爵不让，以遘罪网。前见征讨，畏死苟免；因治人物，寄命须臾。又迫大兵，惶怖北引。从者疾患，死亡略尽；独与老母，共乘一。流矢始交，便弃N就俘，稽颡自首于征役之中。朗惶惑不达，自称降虏。缘前迷谬，被诘惭惧。朗愚浅驽怯，畏威自惊；又无良介，不早自归。于破亡之中，然后委命下隶。身轻罪重，死有余辜。申脰就鞅，蹴足入绊，叱咤听声，东西惟命。","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":146,"end":334,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-6c0d7b0d0c6307efca23","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-bdb723f3bc5117145c5c","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策之始得朗也，谴让之。使张昭私问朗，朗誓不屈。策忿而不敢害也，留置曲阿。","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2306eeaa6e63e60050cb","start":139,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-9102998b8baa516a8d56","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"策令使者诘朗曰：‘问逆贼故会稽太守王朗：朗受国恩当官，云何不惟报德，而阻兵安忍？大军征讨，幸免枭夷；不自扫屏，复聚党众，屯住郡境。远劳王诛，卒不悟顺。捕得云降，庶以欺诈；用全首领，得尔与不？具以状对。’","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":45,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-986906a676aeb62291c2","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6d86d8986119b990a99c","layer":"original","quote":"朗功曹虞翻以为力不能拒〖6〗，不如避之。朗自以身为汉吏，宜保城邑，遂举兵与策战；败绩，浮海至东冶","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-b65912377c18e5653788","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6d86d8986119b990a99c","layer":"original","quote":"策又追击，大破之，朗乃诣策。策以〔其〕儒雅，诘让而不害〖8〗。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-cdb611a9e735ffab3e99","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-666db06c8a588c4d2d84","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策率军如闽、越，讨朗。朗泛舟浮海，欲走交州；为兵所逼，遂诣军降。","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1641ee7b80f85e5d4c75","start":12,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-0871ec4bcb18052d7928","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"乃诈令军中曰：“顷连雨，水浊，兵饮之多腹痛。令促具罂缶数百口，澄水〖5〗。”至昏暮，罗以燃火诳朗","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":113,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-812211891c45b57fe0f7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"是时太守王朗，拒策于固陵〖3〗；策数渡水战，不能克","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-ab16c68fef2d24ca3355","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"便分军夜投查渎道，袭高迁屯","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-c2596cb9014ff91df21b","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1b3a53c12b8e8689cb48","layer":"pei","quote":"曹公起义兵，昕前后遣兵万余人，助公征伐","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14563468a85471f6107d","start":61,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-c57afd5d06b14ea17db8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1b3a53c12b8e8689cb48","layer":"pei","quote":"昕曰：‘我则不德，百姓何罪！’遂散兵，还本郡","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14563468a85471f6107d","start":137,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-da28e1e362b1c518a237","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1b3a53c12b8e8689cb48","layer":"pei","quote":"袁术之在淮南也，昕恶其淫虐，绝不与通","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14563468a85471f6107d","start":81,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e886786466869d86af27","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1b3a53c12b8e8689cb48","layer":"pei","quote":"袁术遣吴景攻昕，未拔。景乃募百姓：敢从周昕者，死不赦","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14563468a85471f6107d","start":110,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-fa41b26c2da52e9bfc0e","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4be2381943ae0472e8eb","layer":"original","quote":"朗大惊，遣故丹杨太守周昕等，帅兵前战。策破昕等，斩之，遂定会稽","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":185,"end":216,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-70570bb8e791b87dc37b","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1b3a53c12b8e8689cb48","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“昕，字大明。少游京师，师事太傅陈蕃。博览群书，明于风角，善推灾异。辟太尉府，举高第，稍迁丹杨太守。曹公起义兵，昕前后遣兵万余人，助公征伐。袁术之在淮南也，昕恶其淫虐，绝不与通。”《献帝春秋》曰：“袁术遣吴景攻昕，未拔。景乃募百姓：敢从周昕者，死不赦。昕曰：‘我则不德，百姓何罪！’遂散兵，还本郡。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14563468a85471f6107d","start":0,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
